       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-SEMANTIC-CSG.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-SEMANTIC-CSG-PROOFS.
           05  WS-CSG-REGULAR-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RAYCAST-PARITY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MANIFOLD-STITCH-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CSG-LATENCY-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-SEMANTIC-CSG-SEAL-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SEMANTIC-CSG-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-CSG-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CSG-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-REGULAR-AND-RAYCAST.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STITCH-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CSG-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-REGULAR-AND-RAYCAST.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CSG-REGULAR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RAYCAST-PARITY-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STITCH-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MANIFOLD-STITCH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CSG-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CSG-PROOFS.
           IF WS-CSG-REGULAR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-RAYCAST-PARITY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MANIFOLD-STITCH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-CSG-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SEMANTIC-CSG-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-CSG-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CSG-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-CSG-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CSG-CODE.
